      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**tiny/src/lib.rs**\n\n```rust\n#![no_std]\n\nextern crate alloc;\n\nuse alloc::format;\nuse alloc::string::String;\nuse alloc::vec::Vec;\n\npub fn labels(values: &[i32]) -> Vec<String> {\n    values.iter().map(|value| format!(\"#{value}\")).collect()\n}\n```"
